{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:28:41.203Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## ip/packing **Type:** Directory":"## ip/packing \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/pool **Type:** Directory":"## ip/pool \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/pool/used **Type:** Directory":"## ip/pool/used \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/proxy/access **Type:** Directory":"## ip/proxy/access \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/proxy/access/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ip/proxy/access/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/proxy/access/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ip/proxy/access/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/proxy/cache-contents **Type:** Directory":"## ip/proxy/cache-contents \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/proxy/cache/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ip/proxy/cache/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/proxy/cache/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ip/proxy/cache/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000IP pools are used to define a range of IP addresses that can be used by various RouterOS utilities, for example, DHCP server, Point-to-Point servers and more. Separate lists for IPv4 and IPv6 are available. Whenever possible, the same IP address is given out to each client(OWNER/INFO pair).":"IP 地址池用于定义可供各种 RouterOS 功能使用的 IP 地址范围，例如 DHCP 服务器、Point-to-Point 服务器等。IPv4 和 IPv6 分别提供独立的列表。只要可能，同一 IP 地址会分配给每个客户端（OWNER/INFO 对）。","docs-7.24\u0000Menu lists all used IP addresses from IP pools.":"该菜单列出 IP 地址池中所有已使用的 IP 地址。"}}
